%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Ep6Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568090
    - rid: 268099980525568091
    - rid: 268099980525568092
    - rid: 268099980525568093
    - rid: 268099980525568094
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568095
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Something smells good...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I guess Hulda's making some breakfast, which I should definitely get
      in on.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099999270699008
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh. Hey, Monika.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099999270699009
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Is that stew as good as it smells?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099999270699010
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What's in it, anyway?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099999270699011
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: It's got tomatoes, as you can probably tell by the color, leeks, and
      garlic.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099999270699012
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Advanced tomato soup, eh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099999270699013
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Can't go wrong with that, I guess...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099999270699014
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hulda, could I get some of that stew, too?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 450344c00cea1104f9790b62b46ab3b1, type: 2}
    dialog: Sure thing, that'll be 5 septims.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I hand over the gold and in return receive a bowl-full of...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Huh. You know, the ingredient line-up screams Italian, but obviously
      the Nords are inspired by... well, the Norse.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Whatever the case, it tastes good so I can forgive the curious amalgamation
      of cultures.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Mmm... yummy!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh yeah, I should probably ask Monika about that-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika, you're the captain of the guard here, right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099999270699015
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh? Oh, yeah, that's right.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099999270699016
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Good, 'cause I'll need your help to trap a dragon in Dragonsreach.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh... how?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099999270699017
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: There's this big yoke mechanism in the balcony that can be slammed down
      on a dragon's neck.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099999270699018
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It takes two people to operate it, <i>and</i> the guards are the ones
      who use it in the actual game.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So you'll need me to get some guards to help you with that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That's right.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100043383767041
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It'd also help if you vouch for the plan if the Jarl raises any concerns
      about trapping a dragon in his keep.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100043383767042
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That <i>would</i> be a hard sell, ahaha...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100043383767043
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Sure, I can do that.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100043383767044
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I'd have to find the barracks first, though...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100043383767045
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Eh, I'm sure we can find two guys on patrol on the way to Dragonsreach.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Worst-case scenario, I'm pretty sure the barracks is directly to the
      right of the main entrance of Dragonsreach.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100043383767046
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, wait, where are we going to get the dragon?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100043383767047
    - rid: 268100043383767050
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You don't have to worry about that.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: There's a particularly prideful dragon named Odahviing who will, quite
      literally, come when I call his name.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hopefully...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100043383767048
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Hopefully?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100043383767049
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I mean, the reason Odahviing is supposed to come is because his pride
      prevents him from turning down a challenge from a powerful opponent.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100043383767051
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And I may or may not fulfill that condition right now?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We've only been here for four days now-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Which means I haven't really had the time to absorb a bunch of dragon
      souls and level up from doing quests and what not.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>Buuut</i> we also did just defeat Alduin in a fight, so...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The two of us finish our soup.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100043383767052
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sure it'll be fine.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's get going, then.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The two of us head out of the Bannered Mare.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100043383767053
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
